    "lead": 0.35,
    "lines": [
      {
        "t": "So who are the Lil Stars?",
        "start": 0.35,
        "end": 2.05
      },
      {
        "t": "Lilstars, formerly Chogstar, is a digital collectible IP born on Monad.",
        "start": 2.27,
        "end": 7.96
      },
      {
        "t": "Meet the Stars crew: Chogstar, Bunnystar, Foxstar and Bearstar.",
        "start": 8.18,
        "end": 13.27
      },
      {
        "t": "One universe, one IP, and it's growing off-chain too, with IRL blind boxes and merch for holders.",
        "start": 13.49,
        "end": 20.31
      },
      {
        "t": "And people noticed: Backpack, PANews and NFT Evening have all written about them.",
        "start": 20.53,
        "end": 25.66
      },
      {
        "t": "Their motto is that everyone can be a star.",
        "start": 25.88,
        "end": 28.4
      },
      {
        "t": "In Star Raid, your Lil Star is your seat.",
        "start": 28.62,
        "end": 31.26
      },
      {
        "t": "Find them at lilstars.xyz, and on X at lilstarrrs.",
        "start": 31.48,
        "end": 37.05
      }
    ],
